: A reply that calls a client tool with eager_input_streaming: a text
: block, then a tool_use block whose input streams as input_json_delta
: partial_json pieces, split mid-token, to be parsed at content_block_stop;
: stop_reason tool_use. Shapes from the claude-api skill's curl/examples.md
: § Streaming (SSE) and shared/tool-use-concepts.md (Eager input
: streaming).

